# MAPK1/MAPK3 (ERK1/ERK2) signalling cascade — a curated slice
# of the canonical EGF → ERK signalling pathway.
#
# Entity symbols follow HGNC; interaction types follow the
# Pathway Commons v14 schema documented at
# https://www.pathwaycommons.org/.
#
# A real Pathway Commons SIF download (e.g. from
# https://www.pathwaycommons.org/archives/PC2/) can replace this
# file without any code changes — the scenario reads SIF, not
# a hand-coded fixture.

EGF	in-complex-with	EGFR
EGFR	in-complex-with	GRB2
GRB2	in-complex-with	SOS1
SOS1	controls-state-change-of	HRAS
HRAS	controls-state-change-of	RAF1
RAF1	controls-phosphorylation-of	MAP2K1
RAF1	controls-phosphorylation-of	MAP2K2
MAP2K1	controls-phosphorylation-of	MAPK1
MAP2K1	controls-phosphorylation-of	MAPK3
MAP2K2	controls-phosphorylation-of	MAPK1
MAP2K2	controls-phosphorylation-of	MAPK3
MAPK1	controls-phosphorylation-of	ELK1
MAPK3	controls-phosphorylation-of	ELK1
MAPK1	controls-phosphorylation-of	RPS6KA1
MAPK3	controls-phosphorylation-of	RPS6KA1
ELK1	controls-expression-of	FOS
DUSP6	controls-state-change-of	MAPK1
DUSP6	controls-state-change-of	MAPK3
